Why This Market Matters
Assisted reproductive technologies have become an important component of modern infertility care, providing treatment options for individuals and couples experiencing difficulties conceiving. Continued improvements in laboratory technologies, embryo selection, cryopreservation and reproductive medicine are expanding the capabilities of fertility providers.
